OL,3,GNEWSAEx-watchdog told she would
OL,4,A'destroy peace process'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, the Omagh Bombing Inquiry
OL,7,Fwas told Sir Ronnie threatened to take
OL,8,Flegal action to prevent Baroness O'Loan
OL,9,Ffrom publishing a highly critical
OL,10,Freport of the RUC's investigation into
OL,11,Fthe explosion.
